  "invariants": [
    "Closed requires zero open reservations, every attempt terminal or transferred to an outstanding-instrument liability, and a recorded trailing-receipt destination (UNB-RCN-ENT-006)",
    "Value leaves the fund only through the grant lifecycle or a governed sponsor-to-sponsor transfer grant; never as a refund to a donor (UNB-RCN-FIN-013)",
    "An outbound transfer is a sponsor distribution with purpose DAF_TRANSFER_OUT that the sponsor may decline (RR-UNB-WF-014-r1)",
    "The fee cut-off is fixed before the residual is computed, so the residual sweep is not circular (TVS-263)",
    "A closed or archived fund is never reopened; late events become linked children routed by the lineage table"
  ]
}
